
<p><span class="catchln" id="secs_33-12_to_33-66">Secs. 33-12 to 33-66.</span> Sections <a href ="chap_590.htm#sec_33-12">33-12</a> to <a href ="chap_590.htm#sec_33-66">33-66</a>, inclusive, are repealed, provided the repeal of a prior act by this section shall not affect any right accrued or established, or any liability or penalty incurred, under the provisions of such act prior to the repeal thereof.</p>
<p class="source-first">(1949 Rev., S. 5133-5139; 1951, S. 2569d, 2575d; 1951, 1953, S. 2570d; 1959, P.A. 618, S. 137.)</p>
